The film was directed by Russ Meyer and written by Roger
Ebert from a story by Ebert and Meyer.

12
01:16:56,470 --> 01:17:02,470
Originally intended as a direct sequel to the 1967 film Valley of the Dolls, Beyond the
Valley of the Dolls was instead revised as a satirical extension of the original.

13
01:23:21,176 --> 01:23:27,176
Beyond was met with negative reviews upon its initial
release, but it became a box office success.

14
01:29:45,882 --> 01:29:51,882
